This is Sky-Reaver Stormhowl, captain of the airship Fist of Garrosh and commander of this operation.

Your first task is to burn the 7th Fleet to the waterline while it's still at anchor

Captain Drok's marines will hold the harbor entrance while your team works.

Rig powder barrels in the hold of every ship and then regroup at the harbor entrance to inform Blastmaster Sparkfuse, who will trigger the exposives and signal the airship forward. 
